  m_text: "Our brave clown doll found his friends that night, \nAll frozen stiff
    from ghostly fright!\n\nTheir haunting powers filled each room,\nReady to cause
    the clown dolls' doom!\n\nBut our brave hero flung his pies,\nand balloon bombs
    burst before their eyes!\n\nThe ghosts had fled each clown doll's mind,\nAll
    thanks to you, clown, how sweet and kind!"
